reur finale en 2022 seulement, et en sens inverse : les électorats fragiles ont fini au-dessus des sondages ; la validation croisée 2022 → 2017 échoue. Pas essayée au backtest.","wave":"2026-10-22"},{"id":"cevipof","label":"Microdonnées Cevipof (reports, anticipations)","verdict":"en attente d'accès","admitted":false,"published":false,"summary":"80 jeux inventoriés, tous restreints, 47 demandes déposées. L'enquête 2017 publique nourrit déjà l'a priori des reports de second tour ; duels par électorat et anticipations attendent l'accès au CDSP.","wave":"2026-10-22"}],"variables_tested_reference":"docs/backtest-log.md","chronological":{"reference_id":"reference-2026-10-22","reference_asof":"2026-10-22","source_commit":"a89d304","protocol":"docs/10-consolidation.md","results":"docs/results/consolidation-2026-10-22","n_draws":40000,"elections":[2012,2017,2022],"horizons_days":[180,90,30,7],"methods":[{"id":"reference","label":"Référence","description":"Agrégateur bayésien de la projection publiée du 22 octobre."},{"id":"mean14d","label":"Moyenne 14 jours","description":"Témoin : moyenne simple des sondages disponibles des 14 derniers jours, avec les mêmes scénarios, la même loi d'erreur et le même second tour."}],"by_horizon":[{"horizon_days":180,"reference":{"log_score_winner":-0.9384,"log_score_pair":-1.2776,"crps_first_round":2.8694,"coverage_90":0.665152},"mean14d":{"log_score_winner":-1.1133,"log_score_pair":-1.4327,"crps_first_round":2.8893,"coverage_90":0.698485}},{"horizon_days":90,"reference":{"log_score_winner":-0.5182,"log_score_pair":-1.1001,"crps_first_round":1.9759,"coverage_90":0.792424},"mean14d":{"log_score_winner":-0.5101,"log_score_pair":-1.0893,"crps_first_round":1.9557,"coverage_90":0.792424}},{"horizon_days":30,"reference":{"log_score_winner":-0.1164,"log_score_pair":-0.4172,"crps_first_round":1.5082,"coverage_90":0.856061},"mean14d":{"log_score_winner":-0.1245,"log_score_pair":-0.4166,"crps_first_round":1.5559,"coverage_90":0.856061}},{"horizon_day